{"4233400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sync Together", "steam_appid": 4233400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SYNC TOGETHER is a fast-paced parkour game where one or two players control a jet-powered flying vehicle together and try to keep it balanced. Completing the course is the goal, but the real challenge is finishing it in the shortest time with minimal mistakes. The game emphasizes coordination and precise movement alongside quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around 30 different obstacles and traps. Depending on the difficulty level, players have 3 lives, and checkpoints placed at specific areas prevent you from restarting the entire level after every mistake. Since lives are limited, careful progression is essential. In two-player mode, losing coordination almost always results in losing control of the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments such as a fishing village and a carnival area, along with various costumes and character options, make each course feel unique. The vehicle is controlled using the WASD keys; <strong>R</strong> resets the vehicle, <strong>Shift</strong> provides a short boost, <strong>Space</strong> activates the bottom thruster, and <strong>F</strong> allows players to get off the vehicle. Aiming and shooting are done with the mouse. Easy to learn but hard to master, SYNC TOGETHER delivers a strong teamwork-focused gameplay experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/3eaa0e15876a7c6e5a9d4b8bc4d6972d.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SYNC TOGETHER is a fast-paced parkour game where one or two players control a jet-powered flying vehicle together and try to keep it balanced. Completing the course is the goal, but the real challenge is finishing it in the shortest time with minimal mistakes. The game emphasizes coordination and precise movement alongside quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/db0329bf208eab163b9a715a126e9a34.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around 30 different obstacles and traps. Depending on the difficulty level, players have 3 lives, and checkpoints placed at specific areas prevent you from restarting the entire level after every mistake. Since lives are limited, careful progression is essential. In two-player mode, losing coordination almost always results in losing control of the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.poster.avif?t=1778793992\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.webm?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4233400/extras/1936c56070476d889c20741c7dd70053.mp4?t=1778793992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments such as a fishing village and a carnival area, along with various costumes and character options, make each course feel unique. The vehicle is controlled using the WASD keys; <strong>R</strong> resets the vehicle, <strong>Shift</strong> provides a short boost, <strong>Space</strong> activates the bottom thruster, and <strong>F</strong> allows players to get off the vehicle. Aiming and shooting are done with the mouse. Easy to learn but hard to master, SYNC TOGETHER delivers a strong teamwork-focused gameplay experience.</p>", "short_description": "SYNC TOGETHER is a parkour game focused on keeping a jet-powered flying vehicle balanced by working together. Use coordination, speed, and teamwork to finish the course as fast as possible.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Catalan<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/